= Instructions

Chop your @Pineapple chunks{}, juice some @Lemon juice{}, then cut the rest for wedges.

Add all ingredients to a blender:\
@Ice{2 cups}, @Pineapple chunks{1 cup}, @Lemon juice{1 tablespoon}, @Agave syrup{2 tablespoons}
@White rum{4 oz}, @Half and half{1 tablespoon} then blend until smooth.

Divide between two glasses and garnish with @Whipped cream{}, a @Maraschino cherry{}, a @Lemon wedge{}, 
and a @Pineapple chunks{} skewer, if desired. Serve immediately! Enjoy.